                                                "sense_id": "4dc62735-4caa-39c5-b8ef-8a663b7dc934",
                                                "text": "After a 600-year voyage, the good news is we're exactly where we're supposed to be: We have arrived in the Heleus Cluster, Andromeda Galaxy, year 2819."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
